# v06.0: Retry failed webhooks

A webhook delivery that fails is dropped, so a subscriber that was briefly down
misses the event for good.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a failed delivery retries three times with backoff

## Findings

- Filed while sketching an integration nobody has built.

> Test strategy: unit, fail the first two deliveries and assert the third lands.
